WEBVTT

00:02.640 --> 00:04.970
Yunoha Magical Zoo.

00:05.370 --> 00:09.030
So this was the place you wanted to go.

00:09.800 --> 00:10.780
Come!

00:19.310 --> 00:22.380
You see through everything, Allen.

00:22.920 --> 00:24.790
But are you sure?

00:24.790 --> 00:27.670
I'd hate to make you tag 
along with my selfish wish.

00:27.670 --> 00:28.780
I'm sure.

00:28.780 --> 00:31.760
But I didn't peg you as a 
magical creature lover.

00:31.760 --> 00:34.260
R-Rather than magical creatures...

00:37.360 --> 00:38.330
I see.

00:38.330 --> 00:40.750
You want to go to the petting zoo?

00:40.750 --> 00:47.060
Yes. I read about it in a book when I was 
younger, and I've always wanted to go.

00:47.060 --> 00:47.800
Okay!

00:47.800 --> 00:52.940
Then let us enjoy our time to the 
fullest, like we are children again!

00:52.940 --> 00:53.830
Okay!

00:54.240 --> 00:56.670
If there's anything you 
want, feel free to tell me!

00:56.670 --> 00:58.530
I'll buy you anything!

00:58.530 --> 01:00.330
I couldn't ask you to do that.

01:01.820 --> 01:04.070
My gosh! T-Then...

01:04.300 --> 01:06.570
May I have these, please?

01:07.470 --> 01:09.080
Two of them?

01:09.080 --> 01:13.090
Would you... like to wear them with me?

01:15.090 --> 01:20.100
Distance between hearts

01:15.090 --> 01:20.100
Distance between hearts

01:15.360 --> 01:17.160
Oh, I'm sorry!

01:17.160 --> 01:20.090
I'm sure you wouldn't like 
something so childish...

01:20.090 --> 01:21.980
I-I wouldn't mind it at all!

01:22.640 --> 01:24.470
Ring these up, please!

01:27.800 --> 01:30.860
The time for us to finally battle has arrived...

