<b>Petting Zoo</b>

03:02.480 --> 03:05.330
<b>Petting Zoo</b>

03:02.480 --> 03:05.330
<b>Petting Zoo</b>

03:02.480 --> 03:05.330
<b>Petting Zoo</b>

03:03.730 --> 03:05.340
You look great!

03:05.490 --> 03:09.910
<b>Naughty Zoo</b>

03:05.580 --> 03:07.270
So adorable, Allen!

03:07.270 --> 03:08.830
Y-You think?

03:08.830 --> 03:13.220
<i>I think it looks better on you, Charlotte...</i>

03:16.830 --> 03:19.170
It's quite a peaceful place.

03:19.700 --> 03:22.460
Wait, there are hell capybaras here?!

03:22.860 --> 03:28.330
They're ferocious magical beasts that can 
destroy a whole mountain if they're hungry.

03:28.330 --> 03:30.590
You know your stuff, sir!

03:31.240 --> 03:33.360
But please rest assured.

03:33.360 --> 03:36.810
Right now, they're resting 
deep in the forest.

03:36.810 --> 03:40.370
I see, if it's just peaceful magical 
creatures, it should be safe.

03:40.640 --> 03:43.570
How do you like it, Charlotte... Huh?!

03:44.230 --> 03:47.000
Charlotte?! A-Are you okay?!

03:47.360 --> 03:48.370
It's just that...

03:48.370 --> 03:52.510
Th-They're so fluffy and soft and round...!

03:52.920 --> 03:55.500
<i>Does she have a head injury?!</i>

03:55.500 --> 03:58.160
I'm so happy I'm alive.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.990
Thank you, Allen!

04:00.640 --> 04:03.170
I never imagined I could 
see paradise like this.

04:03.170 --> 04:05.770
Now I have no more regrets in life.

04:05.770 --> 04:08.770
You haven't even petted anything yet.

04:09.290 --> 04:11.160
<i>What's so good about them?</i>

04:11.160 --> 04:13.760
<i>They're just magical creatures covered in fur.</i>

04:14.320 --> 04:16.660
Now, let's go inside.

04:16.660 --> 04:18.020
Y-Yes.

04:18.290 --> 04:21.020
I'll fluff the creatures with care!

04:21.790 --> 04:25.020
<i>If she likes them this much, 
I can give her a hand.</i>

04:25.320 --> 04:27.150
May I have a word?

04:27.150 --> 04:28.900
Jeez, you scared me!

04:28.900 --> 04:31.660
You can speak our language?

04:32.000 --> 04:36.290
Yes, I have some basic knowledge 
of magical creature language.

04:36.290 --> 04:38.420
So, how can I help you?

04:38.680 --> 04:42.220
The thing is, my companion has 
taken a great liking to you.

04:42.220 --> 04:45.920
I'll buy you whatever feed you 
want, so would you play with her?

04:45.920 --> 04:48.430
Yay! Of course we would!

04:48.430 --> 04:50.670
<i>Bribery complete.</i>

04:50.980 --> 04:53.180
Hey Charlotte, come over here—

04:53.180 --> 04:53.940
Huh?!

04:55.030 --> 04:56.930
So fluffy...

04:56.930 --> 04:59.110
She seems really nice!

04:58.140 --> 05:00.680
The creatures I've bribed...!

05:00.940 --> 05:02.690
That lady's amazing!

05:02.690 --> 05:06.210
She's so popular with magical 
creatures, I wonder who she is?

05:06.520 --> 05:07.960
Don't tell me she's...?!

05:09.300 --> 05:12.210
I had such a great time!

05:12.210 --> 05:14.190
Good, I'm glad.

05:18.040 --> 05:21.190
I became such great friends with them.

05:21.190 --> 05:22.480
Seems that way.

05:23.010 --> 05:25.460
<i>To translate their words...</i>

05:25.460 --> 05:27.240
Don't you dare touch our lady!

05:27.240 --> 05:29.220
I'll bite off all kinds of vital organs!

05:27.360 --> 05:29.460
Please pet us more!

05:28.510 --> 05:30.460
<i>What a peculiar type of fans!</i>

05:30.720 --> 05:34.470
<i>Even if they're used to humans, 
it's a bit excessive...</i>

05:34.990 --> 05:37.290
<i>But I've seen this before.</i>

05:38.210 --> 05:42.180
Charlotte, let me tell you one thing here.

05:42.180 --> 05:42.920
Yes?

05:43.440 --> 05:47.250
There are many types of magic and 
special skills in the world.

05:47.250 --> 05:51.720
Some of them require innate skills.

05:52.380 --> 05:55.740
Is that why you're so good at magic, Allen?

05:55.740 --> 05:57.030
Yes.

05:57.030 --> 05:59.680
Since I have a talent for magic,

05:59.680 --> 06:03.760
I can use non-verbal incantation, 
which is a high-level skill.

06:03.760 --> 06:06.250
And Charlotte, you may have...

06:06.930 --> 06:10.500
the talent for being a
magical creature tamer.

06:10.500 --> 06:12.770
A-A magical creature tamer?

06:12.770 --> 06:14.220
Just as the name suggests,

06:14.220 --> 06:18.510
it means someone who can communicate 
with magical creatures and use them.

06:18.800 --> 06:22.970
You were able to mesmerize those 
creatures with no training.

06:22.970 --> 06:24.760
It's more than possible.

06:24.760 --> 06:27.520
You think I may have such a power?

06:27.750 --> 06:30.940
Yes. A significant one, I think.

06:31.280 --> 06:35.780
I can barely communicate 
with lower-rank creatures.

06:36.490 --> 06:41.200
<i>Could that be why she's adored 
by the thugs in town?</i>

06:41.670 --> 06:45.520
<i>Talented magical creature 
tamers can take and control</i>

06:45.520 --> 06:48.340
<i>high-ranked beasts like fenrirs at will.</i>

06:49.270 --> 06:53.040
<i>But I've never heard of them 
using their power on humans...</i>

06:53.040 --> 06:54.020
E-Excuse me!

06:54.020 --> 06:54.680
Hm?

06:54.680 --> 06:56.910
I-I saw you earlier at the petting area,

06:56.910 --> 06:59.680
and you were so popular 
with the magical creatures!

06:59.680 --> 07:02.800
Are you... well-known 
magical creature tamers?

07:02.800 --> 07:03.770
What's wrong?

07:03.770 --> 07:05.190
Did something happen?

07:06.340 --> 07:08.560
Please help us!

07:08.560 --> 07:11.190
We don't know what to do!

07:11.450 --> 07:12.420
Huh?

07:13.370 --> 07:16.070
I've brought the magical creature tamers.

07:16.930 --> 07:18.330
Good job!

07:18.330 --> 07:21.340
They seem rather young.

07:21.340 --> 07:22.920
Are you sure about...

07:22.920 --> 07:23.570
Hm?

07:23.930 --> 07:27.330
Are you by any chance the 
son of the Crawfords?

07:27.660 --> 07:29.350
Indeed I am.

07:29.350 --> 07:31.340
Have I met you somewhere before?

07:31.550 --> 07:35.850
Yes, once at the open lecture 
at the Athena Magical Academy.

07:36.720 --> 07:39.340
Someone from the Crawfords! 
That's reassuring!

07:39.340 --> 07:43.240
I'm the director of this magical zoo.

07:43.240 --> 07:46.600
Could you please help us?

07:46.980 --> 07:49.370
Of course, but what seems to be the problem?

07:49.370 --> 07:52.280
It'd be easier to show you.

07:54.490 --> 07:55.370
Wha...?!

08:01.340 --> 08:02.560
A fenrir?!

08:03.090 --> 08:04.720
It's badly injured...

08:04.720 --> 08:08.870
It seems that it got separated from its 
parents and shot by a poacher.

08:09.350 --> 08:11.330
<i>Fenrirs are an endangered species.</i>

08:11.330 --> 08:13.390
<i>Harming one gets you imprisoned.</i>

08:13.390 --> 08:18.160
<i>But since its fur and bones are excellent 
materials for magical equipment,</i>

08:18.160 --> 08:19.880
<i>the poaching never stops...</i>

08:20.100 --> 08:24.400
This is the first time 
we've captured a fenrir.

08:24.740 --> 08:27.900
None of us can communicate with it,

08:27.900 --> 08:31.770
which makes it difficult to get 
close enough to use healing spells.

08:31.770 --> 08:34.020
That is indeed a problem.

08:34.690 --> 08:36.620
Hey, listen to me.

08:36.620 --> 08:38.110
We don't mean to harm you—

08:39.230 --> 08:41.530
It won't even listen.

08:41.800 --> 08:45.460
It's been like this since we found
it, and it hasn't eaten anything either.

08:45.460 --> 08:48.790
I'm not sure if we can wait until 
it's ready to open up to us.

08:49.960 --> 08:51.850
There's no magical
creature tamers on staff?

08:51.850 --> 08:56.800
None that are skilled 
enough to deal with a fenrir...

08:57.260 --> 08:58.800
Fenrir...

09:00.400 --> 09:01.550
Understood.

09:01.550 --> 09:03.320
I'll do the best I can to help—

09:03.320 --> 09:04.560
We have a problem!

09:04.830 --> 09:08.820
The mother of this fenrir
seems to be headed this way!

09:09.070 --> 09:11.320
What?! That's impossible!

09:11.630 --> 09:14.670
When we found the cub, we 
used trace severance magic.

09:14.670 --> 09:15.830
How did it find us...?

09:15.830 --> 09:18.440
The mother must be a very high-ranked fenrir.

09:18.670 --> 09:22.320
That particular individual has 
been around for over 100 years.

09:22.950 --> 09:28.460
<i>Fenrirs are known not only for their 
rarity, but also for their pure strength.</i>

09:28.800 --> 09:33.820
<i>For an individual over 100 years of age, 
wiping out a city would be as easy as pie.</i>

09:34.220 --> 09:36.460
<i>This is indeed bad.</i>

09:37.420 --> 09:40.680
<i>Returning the cub... 
would be a foolish idea.</i>

09:40.680 --> 09:44.460
<i>In her eyes, we're nothing but 
abductors who took away her cub.</i>

09:44.760 --> 09:48.980
We haven't tended its wounds yet, 
so it's dangerous to let it out.

09:48.980 --> 09:52.730
I'm also concerned how the mother would 
react, seeing her cub injured...

09:53.020 --> 09:55.230
We'd only be making the matter worse...

09:55.760 --> 09:56.850
I have no choice.

09:57.610 --> 09:59.750
I'll go stop the mother for now.

10:00.380 --> 10:01.270
No way!

10:01.270 --> 10:03.000
That's impossible!

10:03.330 --> 10:06.000
Don't worry, it's my specialty.

10:06.250 --> 10:09.880
But I'll need you to evacuate 
the zoo guests just in case.

10:09.880 --> 10:11.220
Thank you!

10:11.220 --> 10:12.250
We will!

10:13.160 --> 10:15.640
Good. Now Charlotte, you go with them—

10:15.640 --> 10:16.510
Allen!

10:16.510 --> 10:22.020
You did say earlier that I may have a 
talent for magical creature taming.

10:22.310 --> 10:23.870
I did, but...

10:25.420 --> 10:28.200
Forget it, it's too dangerous.

10:28.200 --> 10:31.530
But I can't sit back and do nothing!

10:32.110 --> 10:33.290
Please!

10:33.680 --> 10:36.280
I'll run away if I feel I'm in danger.

10:36.660 --> 10:38.870
Let me talk to that cub!

10:39.960 --> 10:41.270
Charlotte...

10:41.530 --> 10:43.510
And who exactly...?

10:43.510 --> 10:45.780
She might be able to do it.

10:46.220 --> 10:51.290
She tamed all of the creatures at the 
petting zoo without using magic!

10:51.290 --> 10:54.260
But the creatures there are rather gentle.

10:54.260 --> 10:56.290
She couldn't possibly tame a fenrir...

10:56.640 --> 10:57.560
Exactly.

10:57.560 --> 10:58.360
It's impossible.

10:58.710 --> 11:02.560
<i>Before, she would have backed 
down when I told her no.</i>

11:03.360 --> 11:06.300
<i>When I first met her, she was like a doll.</i>

11:06.560 --> 11:09.020
<i>And now, she's ready to fight for someone.</i>

11:11.080 --> 11:12.560
Then you're on.

11:12.960 --> 11:15.430
Persuade the cub to accept the treatment.

11:15.430 --> 11:16.570
O-Okay!

11:16.960 --> 11:18.250
Mr. Zoo Director.

11:18.250 --> 11:21.580
Could you let her speak to the young fenrir?

11:22.100 --> 11:24.570
She has a talent for 
magical creature taming.

11:24.570 --> 11:27.770
With your recommendation, Mr. Crawford...

11:27.770 --> 11:32.070
Either way, we don't really have a choice.

11:32.380 --> 11:34.750
Good, then that's settled.

11:36.300 --> 11:40.080
<i>Charlotte and I have done things together before.</i>

11:40.080 --> 11:44.090
<i>But this is our first time joining forces!</i>

11:45.590 --> 11:48.360
Well then. Time to talk to the fenrirs.

11:48.740 --> 11:49.510
Yes!

12:02.100 --> 12:04.140
It's paradise.

12:04.140 --> 12:05.600
Indeed, nya.

12:05.870 --> 12:07.940
<i>This is the Yunoha Resort security department.</i>

12:07.940 --> 12:10.630
<i>A fenrir is headed toward us.</i>

12:10.630 --> 12:14.920
<i>Guests are advised to evacuate 
to a safe place immediately.</i>

12:11.830 --> 12:15.310
What?! Way to ruin our vacation!

12:15.310 --> 12:18.290
But we've got the Demon Lord, so we're safe.

12:18.290 --> 12:19.320
True.

12:19.320 --> 12:21.030
I knew I'd find you here.

12:22.280 --> 12:23.640
Nya nya?!

12:22.280 --> 12:23.640
Bro?!

12:23.900 --> 12:26.650
I knew you were following us.

12:26.960 --> 12:29.170
But this worked out perfectly.

12:30.980 --> 12:33.980
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

12:33.980 --> 12:36.980
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

12:40.570 --> 12:44.730
It's said that the mere sight of a 
fenrir would bring you luck...

12:45.000 --> 12:49.180
If that's true, then my luck should 
be through the roof right now.

12:50.500 --> 12:52.690
I should put up a barrier while I can.

12:55.490 --> 12:58.990
This should protect the people 
inside the Yunoha Resort.

12:58.990 --> 13:03.880
I'll buy some time for Charlotte 
to finish persuading the cub.

