A diversion, huh? I'm tickled.

13:34.250 --> 13:36.960
I would have been hurt if the 
defense magic didn't work in time.

13:39.470 --> 13:41.460
Listen to me. I...

13:49.920 --> 13:51.210
No good, huh?

13:51.640 --> 13:53.110
I don't have a choice.

13:53.110 --> 13:54.710
I wish it didn't have to come to this.

13:54.710 --> 13:57.500
Are you sure you want to use magic?

13:57.970 --> 14:02.020
You hurt the fenrir, and the cub 
won't be reunited with their mother.

14:02.020 --> 14:03.980
That would make her sad.

14:04.270 --> 14:06.820
You're... a hell capybara?!

14:06.820 --> 14:09.980
Indeed, that is the name of my species.

14:09.980 --> 14:12.490
I am called Gosetsu.

14:12.830 --> 14:14.940
<i>Could he be the magical zoo's...?</i>

14:15.400 --> 14:18.250
Gosetsu or whatever, what 
do you want from me?

14:18.250 --> 14:24.200
My goal is to rescue that lady who 
is forced to stay by your side.

14:24.200 --> 14:25.520
You mean Charlotte?

14:25.520 --> 14:28.010
Do not speak her name so casually!

14:28.910 --> 14:31.260
How do you know about her?

14:31.260 --> 14:33.240
That's a simple story.

14:33.790 --> 14:38.710
After I snuck out of the magical zoo 
and wandered about different places...

14:38.710 --> 14:42.300
That's when I met her, Lady Charlotte.

14:42.960 --> 14:48.320
I knew I had to do something to 
save the beautiful Lady Charlotte.

14:48.780 --> 14:50.950
Then you showed up.

14:50.950 --> 14:56.100
And I learned of the unfounded 
rumors about Lady Charlotte.

14:56.500 --> 14:59.870
There's no way that beautiful 
lady is an evil woman.

14:59.870 --> 15:04.050
My conviction grew stronger as 
I observed her life after that.

15:04.670 --> 15:07.190
I've also realized...

15:07.190 --> 15:11.800
that I'd have to eliminate you 
to protect Lady Charlotte.

15:12.120 --> 15:13.340
I see.

15:13.340 --> 15:15.790
So you're jealous.

15:15.790 --> 15:17.310
Curse you!

15:24.240 --> 15:25.460
<i>What power...</i>

15:25.460 --> 15:27.430
<i>As expected from the hell capybara.</i>

15:27.680 --> 15:29.380
You are ignorant.

15:29.380 --> 15:34.200
You just idle your time away with Lady 
Charlotte, without even trying to save her.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.950
That's just laziness.

15:35.950 --> 15:37.580
Laziness?

15:37.580 --> 15:39.210
I cannot ignore that.

15:39.210 --> 15:43.200
All you do is corrupt Lady 
Charlotte, instead of saving her.

15:43.820 --> 15:45.990
Then what do you plan to do?

15:45.990 --> 15:49.700
Unleash the power sealed 
inside me to defeat you,

15:49.700 --> 15:52.970
then destroy the Neruz Kingdom.

15:52.970 --> 15:54.260
Destroy?

15:54.260 --> 15:57.220
Do you think that will make Charlotte happy?

15:57.670 --> 16:00.220
This is why I say you're naïve.

16:00.500 --> 16:03.850
That nation is the cause 
of Lady Charlotte's pain.

16:03.850 --> 16:09.680
I shall reduce it to ashes, and I'll show 
you heaps of corpses and rivers of blood.

16:09.980 --> 16:12.480
If you mean to interfere, 
I will not hold back!

16:12.990 --> 16:17.750
I've told the fenrirs you're the 
one who took their cub.

16:17.990 --> 16:21.240
I might not even get my turn with you.

16:21.240 --> 16:22.450
I see.

16:22.450 --> 16:25.740
So the fenrirs' diversion was your idea.

16:26.600 --> 16:29.770
<i>The hell capybara and an army of fenrirs...</i>

16:29.770 --> 16:33.550
<i>Even if I meet them with full force, 
I may not come out in one piece.</i>

16:36.010 --> 16:37.210
Those are...

16:40.710 --> 16:42.030
Allen!

16:42.670 --> 16:44.030
Charlotte!

16:44.030 --> 16:45.520
Is the treatment over?

16:46.130 --> 16:49.300
Yes. I did my best to 
persuade this little one,

16:49.300 --> 16:51.020
who agreed to receive the treatment.

16:51.770 --> 16:54.260
Charlotte, you've grown so reliable.

16:55.460 --> 16:57.280
And what are they...?

16:57.280 --> 17:01.780
I tried to come to you, and they 
said they were worried about me.

17:02.030 --> 17:05.040
Do you... understand their language?!

17:05.040 --> 17:06.560
Y-Yes!

17:06.560 --> 17:09.800
It's not perfect, but I can tell 
what they're trying to say.

17:10.560 --> 17:15.070
<i>It took me half a year to master 
elementary magical creature language.</i>

17:15.630 --> 17:17.690
<i>If she gets proper training,</i>

17:17.690 --> 17:21.280
<i>she might become a magical creature 
tamer strong enough to stand beside me.</i>

17:22.170 --> 17:25.740
Then do you know what that mother 
and child are talking about?

17:25.740 --> 17:28.060
Yes. Um...

17:28.060 --> 17:28.930
What?

17:29.380 --> 17:34.070
The fenrir mother had 
mistaken you as a poacher!

17:34.070 --> 17:36.120
And the one who told that lie is...

17:38.320 --> 17:39.950
Lady Charlotte.

17:39.950 --> 17:43.090
Leave that man this instant 
and come with me.

17:43.090 --> 17:45.570
Stop spouting nonsense!

17:45.570 --> 17:48.830
That man will bring you 
even more misfortune.

17:48.830 --> 17:52.600
You had to flee from your country, 
and yet instead of avenging you,

17:52.600 --> 17:54.920
he leads you down the path of corruption.

17:54.920 --> 17:56.320
That's not true!

17:56.320 --> 18:00.090
Allen gave me peaceful days where 
I don't have to be afraid.

18:00.640 --> 18:04.010
With him, I'm finally able to live.

18:04.530 --> 18:07.640
I will not forgive you if 
you speak ill of Allen!

18:07.640 --> 18:09.860
Y-You don't have to go that far...

18:09.860 --> 18:14.360
I will be able to save you properly...

18:15.190 --> 18:18.120
It seems I shall have to take you away by force!

18:18.570 --> 18:20.370
Charlotte, step back.

18:20.370 --> 18:22.030
Allen Crawford!

18:22.030 --> 18:24.640
There's no way you can save Lady 
Charlotte like that!

18:25.380 --> 18:26.700
Shut up!

18:26.700 --> 18:29.380
I've thought about storming into 
that country numerous times.

18:29.610 --> 18:30.880
Allen...

18:30.880 --> 18:33.720
But I will wait until she's
decided what she wants to do!

18:33.720 --> 18:37.640
Your method will only cause Charlotte pain!

18:37.640 --> 18:40.170
What's so wrong about punishing evil?

18:40.170 --> 18:43.110
I'm sure Lady Charlotte wants that too!

18:45.050 --> 18:47.380
All the more reason I can't let this go.

18:47.380 --> 18:48.740
Wh-What?!

18:49.100 --> 18:54.770
Teaching naughty things to Charlotte 
is a privilege allowed only to me!

19:01.000 --> 19:02.570
Are you all right?

19:03.190 --> 19:05.040
I'm sorry, that was excessive.

19:07.570 --> 19:10.340
I must say it was a good punch.

19:10.340 --> 19:13.030
It fully demonstrated what's in your heart.

19:13.320 --> 19:19.550
It would be boorish of me to come in 
between your affairs of the heart.

19:19.850 --> 19:22.300
Hm? "Affairs of the heart"?

19:22.300 --> 19:26.050
The proof is on your head.

19:26.320 --> 19:27.680
What are you talking about...

19:28.070 --> 19:29.050
Huh?!

19:29.490 --> 19:31.710
I-I-I-I can explain...

19:32.990 --> 19:35.950
Thank you so much for everything!

19:36.200 --> 19:40.200
We heard that you saved a fenrir!

19:40.550 --> 19:42.050
Well, I guess we did.

19:42.050 --> 19:44.380
But the credit should go to her.

19:44.380 --> 19:45.210
What?

19:45.570 --> 19:46.920
But...

19:46.920 --> 19:50.970
The ones who tended to the fenrir's 
wounds were the zoo keepers.

19:51.330 --> 19:55.100
I only talked to the cub...

19:55.100 --> 19:58.960
But if you didn't, things 
wouldn't have gone this well.

19:59.260 --> 20:01.090
You made it happen.

20:01.090 --> 20:02.460
So be proud.

20:02.750 --> 20:04.230
I did...?

20:04.230 --> 20:06.730
Thank you very much, ma'am.

20:06.940 --> 20:10.470
Now we can see them happily running around again!

20:11.410 --> 20:12.480
You're welcome!

20:12.700 --> 20:18.730
<i>The hot spring trip was not only fun, but 
it was also a fruitful event for Charlotte.</i>

20:19.270 --> 20:22.500
<i>Even though I had reservations 
about the trip plan...</i>

20:23.280 --> 20:25.710
Your carriage is ready.

20:25.710 --> 20:26.990
Right this way.

20:27.400 --> 20:29.410
Well then, let's head home.

20:29.410 --> 20:30.300
Yes.

20:30.750 --> 20:32.760
Thank you for everything.

20:33.030 --> 20:34.070
Hmm?

20:38.260 --> 20:39.670
Fenrirs?!

20:39.670 --> 20:41.050
So many of them!

20:41.050 --> 20:45.270
I've never seen them this 
close in all my 200 years!

20:47.130 --> 20:49.750
Did they come to say goodbye?

20:49.750 --> 20:51.260
A-Allen!

20:51.260 --> 20:52.310
Hm?

20:52.310 --> 20:56.010
I almost forgot, the poachers 
who wounded the fenrir were—

20:56.010 --> 20:58.270
I caught the poachers, so no worries.

20:58.560 --> 21:01.770
They seem to have gone 
after baby fenrirs again.

21:01.770 --> 21:04.030
Eruca, Miacha!

21:04.030 --> 21:05.970
I bumped into them at the resort.

21:05.970 --> 21:09.030
So I asked them to apprehend the poachers.

21:09.030 --> 21:10.880
That's amazing!

21:10.880 --> 21:13.780
But why are you two here?

21:13.780 --> 21:16.030
I-I wonder why, nya?

21:16.030 --> 21:18.800
Wh-What a coincidence, huh?!

21:19.040 --> 21:22.420
Anyhow, let's take a look at their faces.

21:22.420 --> 21:24.680
We were this close to getting rich quick!

21:24.680 --> 21:26.040
You'll pay for this!

21:26.040 --> 21:27.890
Next time, we'll catch you!

21:27.890 --> 21:30.180
We're gonna sell you off for a fortune!

21:30.460 --> 21:33.140
I see, no sign of remorse.

21:33.510 --> 21:34.570
In that case...

21:37.570 --> 21:42.420
Don't worry. I just raised 
your defense with my magic.

21:43.650 --> 21:48.200
Now the fenrirs can have safe 
toys to play with... you.

21:48.200 --> 21:49.180
Huh?

23:30.710 --> 23:33.720
Master Allen, I shall do great 
things in the next episode.

23:34.580 --> 23:35.980
Why are you still here?!

23:35.970 --> 23:37.850
Next episode, "Naughty Resident."

23:35.980 --> 23:39.950
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.980 --> 23:39.950
<b>Naughty Resident</b>

23:37.850 --> 23:39.950
Gosetsu, don't tell me you are...?
